## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues
- **Dependency Conflicts**: Use resolutions in root package.json
- **Build Failures**: Check package dependencies
- **Test Failures**: Verify test database setup
- **Publishing Issues**: Check package.json configuration

### Debug Commands
```bash
# Check workspace dependencies
yarn workspaces info

# List all packages
yarn workspaces list

# Check package dependencies
yarn why package-name

# Clean all node_modules
yarn clean
```

## Best Practices

### Package Organization
- Keep packages focused and cohesive
- Minimize cross-package dependencies
- Use proper TypeScript types
- Document package APIs

### Development Workflow
- Use feature branches for development
- Run tests before committing
- Use conventional commits
- Keep packages up to date

### Performance
- Use parallel builds when possible
- Cache build artifacts
- Optimize package dependencies
- Monitor build times